# ================================================================
# PHREEQC example input for openWQ — simple river water
# Nitrogen speciation (nitrate / ammonium) + major-ion equilibrium.
#
# NOTE: do NOT add a "DATABASE ..." line here. openWQ loads the
# thermodynamic database itself (via the module JSON "DATABASE" field).
# A DATABASE line inside the .pqi makes PHREEQC re-load a bare relative
# database from the run CWD, which fails or conflicts.
#
# Equilibrium-only (no KINETICS) to keep the example simple and robust.
# ================================================================
TITLE Simple river water - nitrogen speciation

SOLUTION 1  River water (oxic)
    temp   15.0
    pH     7.6
    pe     10.0
    units  mg/L
    N(5)   3.0        # nitrate, as mg/L N
    N(-3)  0.1        # ammonium, as mg/L N
    Ca     35.0
    Mg     8.0
    Na     12.0
    K      2.0
    Cl     15.0
    C(4)   80.0 as HCO3
    S(6)   18.0 as SO4
    O(0)   9.0        # dissolved O2, as mg/L O
END
